 746:Middlewares/LVGL/lvgl/src/core/lv_obj_style.c **** /**
 747:Middlewares/LVGL/lvgl/src/core/lv_obj_style.c ****  * Get the local style of an object for a given part and for a given state.
 748:Middlewares/LVGL/lvgl/src/core/lv_obj_style.c ****  * If the local style for the part-state pair doesn't exist allocate and return it.
 749:Middlewares/LVGL/lvgl/src/core/lv_obj_style.c ****  * @param obj pointer to an object
 750:Middlewares/LVGL/lvgl/src/core/lv_obj_style.c ****  * @param selector OR-ed value of parts and state for which the style should be get
